---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<footer class="bg-brown-secondary relative">
    <div class="py-10 px-4 w-full max-w-[1120px] m-auto flex flex-col gap-[30px]">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-end justify-between w-full gap-[30px]">
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center md:justify-start w-full md:max-w-[760px] gap-[30px]">
          <img src={`${base}/images/logo-elbaf-footer.webp`} alt="logo-elbaf-footer" class="w-full max-w-[98px] m-auto md:mx-0">
          <span class="font-oxanium-regular text-xs text-brown-primary text-center md:text-start">Ellenka Barista Festival (ELBAF) 2026 adalah kompetisi barista terbesar dan paling bergengsi di Indonesia, diselenggarakan oleh Ellenka Coffee sebagai bentuk apresiasi terhadap ekosistem kopi nasional. ELBAF 2026 menghadirkan 28 barista terbaik perwakilan dari seluruh regional Indonesia dari Sabang sampai Merauke untuk bersaing menunjukkan kreativitas, teknik, dan passion mereka dalam dunia kopi.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-2">
          <span class="font-montserrat-regular text-xs text-brown-primary text-center">Connect With Us</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <a href="#" target="_blank">
              <img src={`${base}/images/fb.webp`} alt="fb" class="w-8 h-8">
            </a>
            <a href="#" target="_blank">
              <img src={`${base}/images/x.webp`} alt="x" class="w-8 h-8">
            </a>
            <a href="#" target="_blank">
              <img src={`${base}/images/ig.webp`} alt="ig" class="w-8 h-8">
            </a>
            <a href="#" target="_blank">
              <img src={`${base}/images/linkedin.webp`} alt="linkedin" class="w-8 h-8">
            </a>
            <a href="#" target="_blank">
              <img src={`${base}/images/yt.webp`} alt="yt" class="w-8 h-8">
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <hr class="w-full bg-brown-primary">
      <span class="font-montserrat-regular text-brown-primary text-[10px] text-center md:text-start">Copyright &copy; 2026 detikcom. All right reserved</span>
    </div>
  </footer>